<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sale at Christchurch was 490 NZ cents per kg clean, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 1,070</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 620</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 408</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - n/a</p>
